work_units.notes:
Extend the existing result-link/run-identity helpers so every component can
request:
  - compare URL ID;
  - result-detail href;
  - receipt href or receipt anchor when available;
  - visible public ID token;
  - accessible full identity string;
  - compact row action label.
Keep URL alias handling separate from display identity. Existing compare
URLs using `short_id` should continue to resolve if the backend/read model
supports them, but visible labels should use the public identity contract
from w1.

Add a compact row action to Matrix and Ranks rows, such as a `Details`
text link, receipt icon link with an accessible label, or an actions column
that remains aligned with frozen columns. The affordance must:
  - be reachable by keyboard;
  - expose the target result ID in accessible text;
  - not force trust badges, platform version, receipt text, and selection
    controls into a tall stacked cell;
  - preserve existing horizontal scroll and sticky-header alignment.

Add tests that fail when:
  - Matrix or Ranks has no reachable detail/receipt affordance for a run;
  - the selected tray displays a compare URL token that does not match the
    public row/detail identity;
  - selection-origin text is concatenated into platform identity;
  - result-detail and compare routes accept the same ID aliases but render
    the canonical public ID consistently.
Browser-check Matrix, Ranks, List, Platform detail, Query Workbench, result
detail, and Compare.
